sequenceDiagram
  participant Client as Lobby client
  participant Transport as Lidgren actor
  participant UDP as UDP socket
  participant Codec as Packet codec
  Client->>Transport: Connect or send message
  Transport->>Codec: Encode reliable or unreliable message
  Codec->>UDP: Send datagram
  UDP-->>Transport: Receive datagram or acknowledgement
  Transport->>Transport: Order, retry, reassemble, or expire fragments
  Transport-->>Client: Decoded game-host packet
